app."],["Presentations.ai is building the future of the documentation tools for teams. Review, approvals and merging."],["I LOVE your product. Literally 10x better than the original I built in PowerPoint."],["I love your product—so easy. You are giving me the gift of time."],["Thank you for making me look like an absolute boss of presentations."],["The Interface is simple, clean, easy to navigate and quick considering the functions it offers."]]}},"quotetext":{"S#":{"list":[["There\'s a difference between fair game and playing games."],["Your time is limited, so don’t waste it living someone else’s life."],["Nothing so needs reforming as other people’s habits."],["Be sure you put your feet in the right place, then stand firm."],["I\'d rather be optimistic and wrong than pessimistic and right."],["Every act of creation is first an act of destruction."]]},"M#":{"list":[["What we have to do... is to find a way to celebrate our diversity and debate our differences without fracturing our communities."],["Your time is limited, so don’t waste it living someone else’s life."],["It is better to keep your mouth closed and let people think you are a fool than to open it and remove all doubt."],["Books serve to show a man that those original thoughts of his aren\'t very new after all."],["When something is important enough, you do it even if the odds are not in your favor"],["Every child is an artist. The problem is how to remain an artist once he grows up"]]},"L#":{"list":[["What we have to do... is to find a way to celebrate our diversity and debate our differences without fracturing our communities."],["Your time is limited, so don’t waste it living someone else’s life."],["It is better to keep your mouth closed and let people think you are a fool than to open it and remove all doubt."],["Books serve to show a man that those original thoughts of his aren\'t very new after all."],["When something is important enough, you do it even if the odds are not in your favor"],["Every child is an artist. The problem is how to remain an artist once he grows up"]]},"AlbertEinstein#":{"list":[["Imagination is more important than knowledge."]]}},"tamsamsomtext":{"M#":{"list":[["TAM"],["SAM"],["SOM"],["PAM"]]}},"commontext":{"V#":{"list":[["Initiation"],["Planning"],["Execution"],["Closure"]]},"S#":{"list":[["High-quality Design"],["Amazing Templates"],["Easy Collaboration"],["Works Everywhere"]]},"M#":{"list":[["Ideas to Stunning presentations, in seconds"],["Simple for beginners, Powerful for pros"],["Get your team on the same page"],["Present anywhere, share anywhere"]]},"L#":{"list":[["Save yourself hours of work by letting Presentations.AI design presentations for you."],["Everything you need to make a great deck — from advanced design options to data integrations — right at your fingertips."],["Give your team a single hub to discuss ideas, make decisions and share feedback - host live meetings and edit together in real time."],["Create your content, collaborate with your team, and publish to the world, all from the single space to everywhere."]]},"X#":{"list":[["Save yourself hours of work by letting Presentations.AI design presentations for you."],["Everything you need to make a great deck — from advanced design options to data integrations — right at your fingertips."],["Give your team a single hub to discuss ideas, make decisions and share feedback - host live meetings and edit together in real time."],["Create your content, collaborate with your team, and publish to the world, all from the single space to everywhere."]]},"#S":{"list":[["Create stunning presentations in seconds."],["Use hundreds of beautiful templates."],["Let your ideas take shape. Zero Stress."],["Create & share anywhere from single space."]]},"#M":{"list":[["Make your presentations stand out, by letting Presentations.AI do the design work for you - in seconds."],["Save time and effort with ready-made designs that are fully customisable."],["Prepare for the unexpected and delight your audience with a seamless presentation that is always right on time."],["Powerful collaboration tools that help you create, organise, review and publish your content to any screen."]]},"#L":{"list":[["This AI-powered presentation tool streamlines the creation of professional slides by transforming research and complex information into compelling content. Its deep learning technology automatically generates infographics and semantic layouts from your content, allowing teams to focus more on delivery rather than design."],["This innovative presentation tool harnesses AI technology to transform complex information into engaging, professional slides. It intelligently generates infographics and optimized layouts from your content automatically, enabling teams to focus their time and energy on perfecting delivery rather than design details."],["Elevate your team\'s performance with Presentations.AI, the all-in-one platform that combines brainstorming and presenting capabilities. Host dynamic live meetings, collaborate seamlessly on ideas, and share presentations for team review. Its intuitive and elegant design empowers modern teams to create and deliver impactful content."],["Presentations.ai is a comprehensive collaboration platform that revolutionizes how teams create and share content. Work together in real-time from anywhere, using intuitive presentation tools to develop and publish interactive 360-degree content across any screen. Create, organize, and review presentations seamlessly."]]},"VV":{"list":[["High-quality Design","Works Everywhere"],["Amazing Templates","Easy Collaboration"],["Easy Collaboration","High-quality Design"],["Works Everywhere","Easy Collaboration"]]},"VS":{"list":[["High-quality Design","Create stunning presentations in seconds."],["Amazing Templates","Use hundreds of beautiful template."],["Easy Collaboration","Let your ideas take shape. Zero Stress."],["Works Everywhere","Create & share anywhere from single space."]]},"VM":{"list