r all...why not?"],["Why shouldn\'t I keep it?"]]},"roundofapplause":{"list":[["I WILL HUNT YOU DOWN"],["AND GIVE YOU KIND WORDS OF ADVICE BECAUSE I CARE ABOUT YOUR FUTURE"]]},"plan":{"list":[["GO TO SCHOOL"],["MAKE A MEME"],["TEACHER IS STANDING BEHIND YOU"],["THE TEACHER LOVES YOUR MEMES!"]]},"later":{"list":[["5 MINUTES LATER..."]]},"disappointedfan":{"list":[["WHEN YOU FINALLY FIND WHAT YOU’RE LOOKING FOR AND SEE THE PRICE"]]},"line":{"list":[["WHEN YOU WORK SO HARD"],["THEN DIE AT LAST SECOND"]]},"happykid":{"list":[["DADDY FELL INTO POND"],["PPVVVVVVVVVV"]]},"ttg":{"list":[["ALL I SAID WAS THAT"],["I DIDN\'T LIKE HARRY POTTER"]]},"bf":{"list":[["WHAT IT ACTUALLY IS"],["WHAT I THINK MY PLAN IS"]]},"smart":{"list":[["THINK ABOUT HOW STUPID THE AVERAGE PERSON IS"],["THEN REALIZE THAT HALF ARE STUPIDER THAN THAT"]]},"dg":{"list":[["THERE WAS A SPIDER"],["IT’S GONE NOW"]]},"ps":{"list":[["PLEASE"],["MAKE IT STOP"]]},"rollsafe":{"list":[["CAN\'T GET FIRED"],["IF YOU DON’T HAVE A JOB"]]},"willyouslap":{"list":[["MY 6:30AM ALARM"],["ME"]]},"firsttime":{"list":[["FIRST TIME"]]},"thinking":{"list":[["FUN THINKING"],["THE DINO WAY"]]},"distraction":{"list":[["COVID"],["2021"],["HUMANITY"]]},"cheers":{"list":[["CHEERS"],["IT\'S FINALLY FRIDAY"]]},"ui-ux":{"list":[["PRODUCT FEATURES"],["USER NEEDS"]]},"trauma":{"list":[["RCB FANS DURING PRACTICE MATCH"],["RCB FANS DURING REAL MATCH"]]},"tif":{"list":[["CORONA VIRUS SPREADING LIKE WILD FIRE"]]},"yw":{"list":[["GIRL WHEN THEY SEE A SPIDER"],["THE SPIDER"]]},"office":{"list":[["DON\'T GIVE UP ON YOUR DREAMS"],["KEEP SLEEPING"]]},"lowbudget":{"list":[["CLIENT EXPECTATIONS"],["CLIENT BUDGET"]]},"wow":{"list":[["WOW"],["OOOOOFF"]]},"um":{"list":[["UM, NO"],["AND NO."]]},"confidence":{"list":[["WALK AWAY FROM EXPLOSION"],["LIKE A BOSS"]]},"happy":{"list":[["THIS IS ME"],["OWNING MY ON BUSINESS"]]},"announcement":{"list":[["Coming Soon","Want to create a gorgeous presentation but don\'t have time or design skills? No worries. Presentations.AI will make you look a presentation super-hero to your customers, partners and work colleagues."]]}},"stacks":{"imagestack-common":{"list":[["One Application, Many Powers","Turn your ideas into incredible digital experiences. The most powerful design toolbox to create your next presentation."],["Inspiring Presentation Templates","One size doesn’t fit all. That’s why our huge library of 60+ templates has everything you need to make projects that suit your presentation."],["Transitions and Animations","Presentation.AI uses a powerful animation system to give layers motion and transitions."]]},"imagestack-simple":{"list":[["One Application, Many Powers"],["Inspiring Presentation Templates"],["Transitions and Animations"]]},"imagestack-client":{"list":[["It is a long established fact that a reader will be distracted by the readable content of a page when looking at its layout. The point of using Lorem Ipsum is that it has a more-or-less normal distribution of letters, as opposed to using \'Content here, content here\', making it look like readable English. Many desktop publishing packages and web page editors now use Lorem Ipsum as their default model text, and a search for \'lorem ipsum\' will uncover many web sites still in their infancy.","Laurie R. , CEO"],["There are many variations of passages of Lorem Ipsum available, but the majority have suffered alteration in some form, by injected humour, or randomised words which don\'t look even slightly believable. If you are going to use a passage of Lorem Ipsum, you need to be sure there isn\'t anything embarrassing hidden in the middle of text.","Keith B. , CFO"],["On the other hand, we denounce with righteous indignation and dislike men who are so beguiled and demoralized by the charms of pleasure of the moment, so blinded by desire, that they cannot foresee the pain and trouble that are bound to ensue; and equal blame belongs to those who fail in their duty through weakness of will, which is the same as saying through shrinking from toil and pain. These cases are perfectly simple and easy to distinguish.","Niel L. , CTO"]]},"imagestack-browser":{"list":[["Color Setting","On the other hand, we denounce with righteous indignation and dislike men who are so beguiled and demoralized by the charms of pleasure of the moment, so blinded by desire, that they cannot foresee the pain and trouble that are bound to ensue; and equal blame belongs to those."],["Export Setting","There are many variations of passages of Lorem Ipsum available, but the majority have suffered alteration in some form, by injected humour, or randomised words which don\'t look even slightly believable."],["Chart Data","Many desktop publishing packages and web page editors now use Lorem Ipsum as their default model text, and a search for \'lorem ipsum\' will uncover many web sites still in their infancy."],["Mood Setting","If you are going to use a passage of Lorem Ipsum, you need to be sure there isn\'t anything embarrassing hidden in the middle of text. All the Lorem Ipsum generators on the Internet tend to repeat predefined chunks as necessary, making this the first true generator on the Internet."]]},"textstack-common":{"list":[["Presentation Superpowers","Want to create a gorgeous presentation but don\'t have time or design skills? No worries. Presentations.AI will make you look a presentation super-hero to your customers, partners and work colleagues."],["Designer-in-a-box","Presentations.AI is the first presentation tool to truly liberate you from the tyranny of needing to be a designer to create impactful presentations. Create amazing presentations in half the time with absolutely no design inputs. All at the touch of a button."],["A joyful way to make an impact","It\'s speed makes your work less of a burden and more of a joy. And it\'s smart, guiding you to the results you want every time."]]},"announcement-common":{"list":[["Coming Soon","Want to create a gorgeous presentation but don\'t have time or design skills? No worries. Presentations.AI will make you look a presentation super-hero to your customers, partners and work colleagues."]]},"signboard-common":{"list":[["Idea Ahead"]]},"blackboard-common":{"list":[["Stunning Decks Made Effortlessly"]]},"stickynotes-common":{"list":[["Presentation Superpowers","Want to create a gorgeous presentation but don\'t have time or design skills? No worries. Presentations.AI will make you look a presentation super-hero to your customers, partners and work colleagues."]]},"textstack-flip":{"list":[["Presentation.ai FASTER"],["Presentation.ai EASIER"],["Presentation.ai BETTER"]]},"appscreen-common":{"list":[["A rider opens the app","The rider enters their destination into the “Where to?” box; reviews each ride option for vehicle size, price, and estimated dropoff time; chooses the desired option; then confirms the pickup."],["The rider is matched with a driver","A nearby driver sees and chooses to accept the rider’s ride request. The rider is automatically notified when the driver’s vehicle is about a minute away."],["The driver picks up the rider","The driver and the rider verify each other’s names and the destination. Then the driver starts the ride."],["The driver takes the rider to the destination","The app gives the driver the option to access turn-by-turn directions."],["The driver and rider leave ratings and reviews","At the end of each trip, drivers and riders can rate each other from 1 to 5 stars. Riders also have the option to give the driver compliments and a tip directly in the app."]]},"heroimage-common":{"list":[["Business Consulting Services: Driving Success","Our consulting services focus on driving business growth and efficiency through innovative strategies. We provide expert guidance in finance, operations, and digital transformation to help your business succeed."]]},"herotext-common":{"list":[["Order and pick up. Easy as that.","Just open the app, order your favorites, and enjoy contactless pay. From there, choose whichever pickup method is best for you.","STARBUCKS"]]}},"plainlist":{"imagelayoutlist":["Teases our innovative product, offering a sneak peek.","Redefines industry standards with its sleek design and innovative features.","Sparks curiosity, leaving viewers eager for more details.","Hints at the transformative impact it will have on the industry.","Evokes anticipation, setting the stage for an industry game-changer."],"numberlist":["AI identifies relevant keywords for improved visibility in headline optimization.","AI gauges emotional tone to create engaging headlines.","AI-driven testing refines headline performance.","AI creates detailed audience personas for tailored messaging.","AI generates concise content summaries for effective headlines."],"imagebrowserlayoutlist":["Our Exceptional Sales Performance","This Week A comprehensive overview of your business.","Highlighting its growth potential, market opportunity, and financial performance."],"titlelist":["Friendly","Flexible","Reliable","Realtime","Scalable"],"textboxlist":["Ideas to Stunning presentations, in seconds","Simple for beginners, Powerful for pros","Present anywhere, share anywhere","Built for modern teams to do great work together"],"subtype":["Sub-Heading 1","Sub-Heading 2","Sub-Heading 3","Sub-Heading 4"],"subtypecard":["Ideas to Stunning presentations, in seconds","Simple for beginners, Powerful for pros","Present anywhere, share anywhere","Built for modern teams to do great work together"],"listlabel":["Label 1","Label 2","Label 3","Label 4"],"personname":["Sarah Barret","Samuel Johnson","Teresaperkins","Ellen Moore"],"persondes":["Senior Project Manager","Project Manager","VP of Research & Planning","VP of Sales & Marketing"],"persondesc":["Senior Project Manager","Project Manager","VP of Research & Planning","VP of Sales & Marketing"],"personplace":["Tokyo,Japan","Berlin,Germony","Nairobi,Kenya","Rio,Brazil"],"personintro":["Self Introduction"],"personintrodesc":["A visionary leader with over 20 years of experience in scaling businesses in the tech and retail sectors. Ravi excels in operational efficiency, strategic planning, and fostering innovation within organizations."],"personbio":["Bio"],"personbiodesc":["This person has a deep understanding of the Indian and global markets, having led multi-billion-dollar corporations to success. Their focus on innovation, team building, and market expansion has allowed companies under their leadership to thrive."],"personskill":["Skills"],"personskilldesc":["Strategic Business Planning,Operational Efficiency,Innovation Management,Team Leadership and Development,Market Expansion Strategies,Customer Experience Enhancement"],"personachievement":["Achievements"],"personachievementdesc":["Achieved 40% revenue growth in three years at Retail Solutions Ltd, earned \'CEO of the Year\' recognition, expanded operations across India, and implemented tech solutions that optimized operations and enhanced customer experience."]},"author":{"teamlist":[["#COMPANY_EXECUTIVE_NAME_1#","#COMPANY_EXECUTIVE_DESIGNATION_1#"],["#COMPANY_EXECUTIVE_NAME_2#","#COMPANY_EXECUTIVE_DESIGNATION_2#"],["Sarah Barrett","Senior Project Manager"],["Samuel Johnson","Project Manager"],["Teresaperkins","VP of Research & Planning"],["Ellen Moore","VP of Sales & Marketing"]],"authorlist":[["Hillary Clinton","American Politician"],["Steve Jobs","CEO Apple"],["Mark Twain","American Writer"],["Abraham Lincoln","American Lawyer"],["Elon Musk","CEO SpaceX"],["Pablo Picasso","Spanish Painter"]],"alberteinstein":[["Albert Einstein","Physicist"],["Steve Jobs","CEO Apple"],["Mark Twain","American Writer"],["Abraham Lincoln","American Lawyer"],["Elon Musk","CEO SpaceX"],["Pablo Picasso","Spanish Painter"]]},"kanban":{"S#":{"list":[["To do"],["In Progress"],["Completed"]]}}},"textbox":{"textbox-plain":{"value":"In our fast-paced digital age, crafting headlines that swiftly capture readers\' attention is critical. AI-enhanced headline crafting seamlessly blends human creativity with artificial intelligence precision. This innovative approach empowers content creators and communicators to construct succinct yet impactful headlines, optimized for rapid comprehension. \\nBy harnessing advanced AI algorithms that meticulously analyze trends, keywords, and evolving audience preferences, AI-enhanced headline crafting transforms the art of communication. It addresses the challenge of engaging busy readers who often skim content for essentials. \\nThis presentation explores the captivating world of AI-enhanced headline crafting, revealing techniques, tools, and strategies for creating headlines that resonate deeply and drive audience engagement. Leveraging AI insights significantly enhances content delivery efficiency, ensuring messages pack maximum impact. \\nJoin us in exploring the intersection of human creativity and AI. Discover how AI simplifies crafting concise headlines, making success in our fast-paced digital era more achievable. Whether you\'re a content creator, marketer, or communicator, this presentation provides invaluable insights into harnessing AI\'s power for effective communication."},"textbox-plain-short":{"value":"In our fast-paced digital age, crafting headlines that swiftly capture readers\' attention is critical. AI-enhanced headline crafting seamlessly blends human creativity with artificial intelligence precision. \\nThis presentation explores the captivating world of AI-enhanced headline crafting, revealing techniques, tools, and strategies for creating headlines that resonate deeply and drive audience engagement. Leveraging AI insights significantly enhances content delivery efficiency, ensuring messages pack maximum impact. \\nJoin us in exploring the intersection of human creativity and AI. Whether you\'re a content creator, marketer, or communicator, this presentation provides invaluable insights into harnessing AI\'s power for effective communication."},"textbox-plain-medium":{"value":"Artificial Intelligence is revolutionizing industries by automating processes, enhancing decision-making, and driving innovation at an unparalleled pace. Through advanced algorithms and data analysis, AI empowers businesses to optimize operations, deliver personalized experiences, and solve complex challenges. From healthcare breakthroughs to smarter financial systems and improved education, its impact is profound and far-reaching. AI fosters creativity, improves efficiency, and creates opportunities for growth across various sectors. However, its rapid adoption also brings challenges, including ethical concerns, data privacy, and societal implications. By leveraging AI responsibly and thoughtfully, we can unlock its full potential and build a future that benefits everyone."},"textbox-list":{"value":"This image gives you a sneak peek at our groundbreaking product. It’s sleek design and innovative features will redefine industry standards, leaving you curious for more details. Brace yourself for the transformative impact it\'s about to make, setting the stage for an industry game-changer."},"persorn-info":{"value":"Hello, everyone! My name is David Johnson, and I am thrilled to introduce myself as a Senior Data Analyst. With a passion for uncovering insights and making data-driven decisions, I have had the privilege of working in the field of data analysis for over a decade.As a Senior Data Analyst, my role revolves around collecting, organizing, and analyzing large datasets to extract meaningful information. I specialize in identifying patterns, trends, and correlations that can provide valuable insights and guide strategic decision-making within organizations. Equipped with a strong background in statistical analysis and proficiency in various analytical tools and programming languages."}},"titlecta":{"titlecta-a":{"value":"Call-to-Action"}},"placeholder":{"placeholder-image":{"id":"PLACEHOLDER_IMAGE","type":"image","value":"genericassets/images/app/rocketlaunch.jpg"},"placeholder-icon":{"id":"PLACEHOLDER_ICON","type":"icon","value":"default/best.svg"},"placeholder-logo":{"id":"PLACEHOLDER_LOGO","type":"logo","value":"#COMPANY_PRIMARY_LOGO#"},"placeholder-text":{"id":"PLACEHOLDER_TEXT","type":"text","value":"$200,000"},"placeholder-image-text":{"id":"PLACEHOLDER_TEXT","type":"text","value":"#1"},"placeholder-logo-grid":{"id":"PLACEHOLDER_LOGO","type":"logo","logogrid":"logolist"}},"singlenode":{"iconasset":{"value":"default/best.svg","id":"best","type":"icon","contenttype":"icon"},"illusasset":{"value":"title.svg","id":"title","type":"illustration","contenttype":"illustration"},"number":{"value":"$2000","type":"text","contenttype":"number"},"numberlarge":{"value":"$20,000,000","type":"text","contenttype":"number"},"numbermedium":{"value":"7%","type":"text","contenttype":"number"},"singlenumber":{"value":"5","type":"text","contenttype":"number"},"singlelogo":{"value":"genericassets/images/app/google.png","type":"logo","contenttype":"singlelogo"},"microchart":{"value":"64","type":"text","contenttype":"microchart"}},"items":{"single_series":{"list":[["Meta","83,553"],["Uber","32,500"],["Paypal","30,900"],["Netflix","11,300"],["Spotify","9,058"],["Twitter","7,500"],["Airbnb","6,132"]],"properties":{"projectiontext":"Forecast data of companies workforce","sourcetextname":"Source: Companies Market Cap","labelheader":"Company","itemheader":"Net Profit values in Millions","prompttext":["0% - 2%","2% - 4%","0% - 2%","3% - 5%","7% - 9%","3% - 5%","7% - 9%"]}},"double_series":{"list":[["2019","176","38"],["2020","68","25"],["2021","102","33"],["2022","122","37"],["2023","135","40"],["2024","145","43"],["2025","150","44"]],"properties":{"multiserieslegend":"Hotels & Similar accommodation*, Short-term rentals**","projectiontext":"Forecast data of companies workforce"}},"triple_series":{"list":[["Germany*","150","148","110"],["Norway","130","124","114"],["Russia**","126","82","106"],["U.S.","110","112","83"],["Austria","70","86","76"],["Can